        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series, Georgian Door Knob Set With Traditional Camelot Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design with an even easier installation, this door knob and rose will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home both on the interior and the exterior. The traditional styling of the Georgian Knob with the Camelot Rose allows it to blend in seamlessly despite ever-changing trends in decor. Made by Schlage, this knobset fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. Available in an array of finishes in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Georgian Door Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece knob for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 series 4000 grade 2 keyed entry function.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the F-Series Georgian Schlage Door Knob Camelot Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Round Corner (1/4\" radius corners)</li>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate: 1-5/8\" x 2-1/4\" Round Corner Full Lip Strike Plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the knob while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Georgian Knob With Camelot Rose, Schlage F-GEO-CAM",
                "description": "Schlage Georgian Knob With Camelot Rose F-GEO-CAM - Simple in design with an even easier installation, this door knob and rose will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home both on the interior and the exterior. The traditional styling of the Georgian Knob with the Camelot Rose allows it to blend in seamlessly despite ever-changing trends in decor. Made by Schlage, this knobset fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses. Available in 6 finishes in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.",
                "keywords": "SCH-Georgian-Knobs, Schlage f series Georgian door Knobs, F170GEO, dummy Knobs, F10GEO, passage Knobs, f40GEO, privacy Knob sets, f51GEO, keyed entry Knob locksets, schlage f-series door Knobs, Schlage door hardware Georgian Knobs, Georgian schlage Knobs, scroll door Knobs, SCH-F-GEO-CAM, Schlage Camelot collections, schlage Camelot rose, schlage F GEO CAM, Traditional door Knobs, half-round knobs,"
